silm:instances_papers_01_orientation_chapters_14_kleisli_enrichment_pipeline_sections_03_cite_as_kleisli_arrow_decomposition_step_1__step_cite__source__>_freesigmawitness a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "The cite Kleisli arrow has domain Source (a source identifier: file path, DOI, or local key) and codomain Free(Sigma)(Witness). It produces a free-monad term of sort Witness without interpretation." .
